            <ul style='color: #334155; margin-left: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 0.9rem;'>
                <li style='margin-bottom: 0.5rem;'><b>FastAPI backend</b>: Asynchronous routes with validation using Pydantic schemas.</li>
                <li style='margin-bottom: 0.5rem;'><b>Streamlit frontend</b>: Visual dashboards mapping user data tables.</li>
                <li style='margin-bottom: 0.5rem;'><b>Uvicorn</b>: Lightning-fast ASGI runner hosting the endpoint interface.</li>
